## What to change

1. Parse numeric dates in the tenant's locale order, or accept only an unambiguous format.
2. Make booking-v3's hint match the tenant locale and parse the value in that same order.

The desk should split the 33 booking-v3 hint reports from #4471. The remaining 379 reports
belong to the shared parser failure already represented by #4471.

